Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.76,0:12:38.00,Panel,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(72,823)\bord0\shad0\1c&H261814&\1a&H30&\fad(250,600)\p1}m 0 0 l 1777 0 1777 183 0 183
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:46.74,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Now, without further ado, let's introduce today's guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.74,0:11:52.48,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,840)}It's Chouchou-P-san, who wrote "The name of painting" for Nightcord at 25:00!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.48,0:11:53.60,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,840)}Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:54.88,Chouchou-P,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,840)}Good evening, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:11:55.60,Chouchou-P,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,840)}I'm Chouchou-P.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.60,0:11:56.84,Chouchou-P,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,840)}Nice to meet you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.84,0:11:57.52,Minori Suzuki,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,840)}Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.76,0:12:02.28,Ai Shimizu - Slide,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,908)}Allow me to introduce him.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.28,0:12:08.90,Ai Shimizu - Slide,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,908)}Chouchou-P-san began posting songs as Vocaloid producer Chouchou-P in 2008.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.90,0:12:15.61,Ai Shimizu - Slide,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,908)}In 2011, he released his first album under the Chouchou-P name, and as a guitarist and keyboardist,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.61,0:12:20.84,Ai Shimizu - Slide,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,908)}he's performed on many stages, including the Budokan and Saitama Super Arena.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.84,0:12:25.90,Ai Shimizu - Slide,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,908)}In 2017, he also made his major-label debut as singer-songwriter Yu Ichinose.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.90,0:12:30.62,Ai Shimizu - Slide,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,908)}Since then, beyond his own work as Chouchou-P and Yu Ichinose,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.62,0:12:38.00,Ai Shimizu - Slide,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,908)\fad(0,600)}he's also been actively writing and producing songs for other artists, anime, games, and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.39,0:12:38.89,Chouchou-P,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:43.95,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,It's pretty rare for you to appear on shows like this, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.88,0:12:43.84,Chouchou-P,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is practically my first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.95,0:12:44.45,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Oh, we're so grateful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.44,0:12:46.96,Chouchou-P,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,I'm super nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.32,0:12:51.72,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Right, we've got so much we want to ask, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.72,0:12:52.22,Minori Suzuki,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,We sure do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.16,0:12:58.13,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,We'd love to hear all sorts of stories, so please bear with us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:12:58.00,Chouchou-P,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Thank you for having me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.13,0:12:58.63,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.63,0:13:03.40,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,And so, today we'll be livening up Sekai of Vocalo Music together with Chouchou-P-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.08,0:13:05.96,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Now, first up is this corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.00,0:18:55.96,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.80,0:19:01.48,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Now, let's move right on to our Q&A corner for Chouchou-P-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.12,0:19:01.62,Chouchou-P,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.48,0:19:03.58,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,It's the Q&A Corner for Our Guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:04.56,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting!
Comment: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:10.54,Ai Shimizu,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:10.54,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,From here, let's listen to the Nightcord at 25:00 song Chouchou-P-san wrote for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.54,0:19:15.00,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,"The name of painting," as we hear more from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.04,0:19:20.36,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,So, let's get right to it and start with the title.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.31,0:19:19.81,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.36,0:19:21.64,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.92,0:19:23.52,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,The title?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.22,0:19:23.72,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:25.28,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm gonna cry already, geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.44,0:19:33.82,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,So actually, while I was making the song, I had a sort of working title,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.82,0:19:41.24,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,which was just "Title," as in the title of the painting Ena paints,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.24,0:19:43.76,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,so a working title of "Title"...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.76,0:19:47.52,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,A working title called "Title" is kind of confusing, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.52,0:19:49.36,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,So you named it "Title."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:51.64,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,And when I submitted it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.64,0:19:57.52,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,they didn't realize that was meant as the song name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.52,0:19:58.15,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.15,0:19:59.14,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Ah, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.73,0:19:59.64,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.14,0:19:59.64,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.64,0:20:01.48,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,It was only temporary, so that was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.16,0:20:05.80,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Then, while I was wondering if there was something better,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:09.47,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,I thought, why not just make it a question
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.47,0:20:14.18,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,asking the painting's name, and use that as the title,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.29,0:20:10.79,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.18,0:20:15.48,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,and that's how we got this title.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.36,0:20:24.00,DefaultOnibe - TL Note,,0,0,0,,TL Note: The Japanese title その{\c&H0088AACC&}絵{\r}の{\c&H0088AACC&}名{\r}前は hides Ena's name, {\c&H0088AACC&}絵名{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.36,0:20:21.39,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,And then, lo and behold, her name was in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.04,0:20:19.68,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.39,0:20:22.00,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.00,0:20:23.60,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,So that was unintentional?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.60,0:20:24.54,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.57,0:20:26.07,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.29,0:20:27.79,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Comment: 0,0:20:30.15,0:20:31.08,Chouchou-P - Shifted,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.15,0:20:31.08,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.08,0:20:34.36,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Now, speaking of something that was intentional,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.36,0:20:38.72,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,you had a particular idea for the global, or English, title, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.72,0:20:39.60,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.60,0:20:59.00,DefaultOnibe - TL Note,,0,0,0,,TL Note: th{\c&H0088AACC&}E{\r} {\c&H0088AACC&}NA{\r}me of painting → {\c&H0088AACC&}ENA{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.60,0:20:44.92,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,In English, I believe the title is "The name of painting,"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.92,0:20:48.30,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,and it says "name" instead of "The title of painting"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.30,0:20:54.24,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,so that when you read it, Ena's name is in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.84,0:20:59.00,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,The E in "the" and the "na" in "name" make "Ena"!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:00.64,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Yeah, that part was very deliberate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.48,0:21:06.44,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Just the title alone is so good, I could eat bowls of rice with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.44,0:21:09.20,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm just so grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.20,0:21:13.00,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,As her performer, I kind of feel like Ena's parent,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.00,0:21:16.84,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,and when I got it, I'd received the lyrics for "The name of painting."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.52,0:21:24.22,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,It was like a love letter, a treasure of a song that's the culmination of
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.22,0:21:28.08,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,who this girl is now, and I was like, wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.08,0:21:29.20,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,so I practiced like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:36.00,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,I remember thinking, "I have to live up to Chouchou-P-san's feelings!"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.52,0:21:40.45,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,A song received with such care!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.45,0:21:46.04,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Now, for the lyrics, Chouchou-P-san, what did you focus on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.72,0:21:52.08,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,For the lyrics, there's an instrumental break, and after it ends,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:55.76,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,from "the reality thrust before me..."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.55,0:21:55.05,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.76,0:22:01.20,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,that part of the lyrics is pretty much what I most wanted to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.69,0:22:03.52,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.52,0:22:04.44,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,I've had goosebumps this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.92,0:22:09.40,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,So how did you go about weaving these lyrics?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.92,0:22:16.08,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,For lyrics, I usually write them once the whole song is done,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.08,0:22:19.44,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,and I'd been told about Ena,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.44,0:22:25.30,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,and given an idea in advance of how the story was going to unfold,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.30,0:22:32.10,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,so I looked at all that, and, well, Ena has a creator side to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.10,0:22:35.30,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,and as someone who makes music,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.30,0:22:38.70,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,though saying "the same" is a bit much,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.70,0:22:42.02,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,there were things I could relate to,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.02,0:22:47.32,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,and I hoped I could express that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.76,0:22:54.89,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Right? I also think the line "the answer isn't just one"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.89,0:22:57.41,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,really captures Ena.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.41,0:23:03.68,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Until now, Ena probably believed this path was,
Comment: 0,0:23:03.68,0:23:06.68,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.68,0:23:06.68,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,for her, as an artist, the very best one,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.68,0:23:08.24,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,and because she couldn't manage it,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.24,0:23:12.56,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,she went through setbacks and frustration, and grew from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.56,0:23:17.48,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Then she realizes there's a new, different path to art that's hers,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.48,0:23:20.40,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,and I feel like that whole story is packed in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.20,0:23:24.08,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's just too genius. Yeah, it really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.08,0:23:28.96,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Words like these don't even do it justice. I'm just so grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.96,0:23:33.52,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Speaking as a fan myself, Suzuki-san's singing is part of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.52,0:23:36.54,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,but when I saw Chouchou-P-san's work,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.54,0:23:39.44,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,I thought the "even so" in the chorus was so Ena,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.44,0:23:44.40,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,like, not "but" or "however," but "even so." That's so Ena.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.80,0:23:47.64,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.36,0:23:51.08,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Ena's feelings come through,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:55.20,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,and the opening part sung in the SEKAI version playing now,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.20,0:24:00.64,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,even the line split felt like each member of N25. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.93,0:24:00.43,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.64,0:24:04.88,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san, what were you thinking about while singing at the recording?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.40,0:24:06.66,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.66,0:24:12.52,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's like looking back on your past self, with what's playing right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.08,0:24:15.84,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Toworu-san's, Nekome Toworu's illustrations.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.84,0:24:20.48,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Following them, I looked back on Ena's life from birth to today,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.48,0:24:23.84,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,singing as if she'd never regret it, and doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.84,0:24:29.10,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Old Ena would've sung the painful parts as painful,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.85,0:24:24.35,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.10,0:24:31.58,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,and the sad parts tearfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.58,0:24:37.00,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,But today's Ena would think even those were worth having,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.00,0:24:40.79,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,so I tried not to get pulled in too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.79,0:24:43.36,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,and sang each line as today's Ena,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.36,0:24:47.84,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,letting it sink into my heart one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.84,0:24:49.59,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Like you said earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.59,0:24:55.24,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,"even so" isn't a total denial like "but" or "however." It's more like,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.24,0:24:58.68,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,"That's true, but this is too," kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.68,0:25:00.16,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Like, "I won't give up on either."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.84,0:25:05.32,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Truly, Ena's kindness and strength, a positive song
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.32,0:25:07.87,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,that never denies her past...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.87,0:25:09.84,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,How could it be this good?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.84,0:25:15.00,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,This one song lets you understand who Ena Shinonome is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.12,0:25:20.32,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Seriously, thank you so much for such a wonderful song.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.68,0:25:20.24,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.32,0:25:22.96,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's a song I really, really want to frame and hang on my wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.75,0:25:24.92,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,The song too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.27,0:25:24.77,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.92,0:25:26.80,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Though that's a bit tricky, since it has no physical form.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.44,0:25:28.84,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,I just love it so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.84,0:25:34.72,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Chouchou-P-san, how did you feel when you got the song she recorded?
Comment: 0,0:25:35.48,0:25:40.09,Chouchou-P - Shifted,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.48,0:25:40.09,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Well, it really felt like a soul had come to dwell in the song.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.09,0:25:40.59,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Aw, I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.44,0:25:46.64,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,My very first thought was, "I'm really glad I made this."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.21,0:25:47.81,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.81,0:25:48.76,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.76,0:25:49.84,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,So glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.40,0:25:53.88,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,You watched over the session remotely, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.88,0:25:54.38,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.96,0:26:03.02,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,There was already the pressure of it being made by a legend,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.02,0:26:05.34,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,someone I'd listened to forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.34,0:26:09.30,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,plus the pressure of having to nail this important song for Ena,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.30,0:26:13.12,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,so I was so nervous, but I got takes I was happy with.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.64,0:26:22.12,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,I always record one take of just my part of the SEKAI version,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.12,0:26:28.34,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,and one take as if Ena sang the whole song through,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.34,0:26:34.97,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,so between the game size and this full size,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.97,0:26:41.74,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,even the same lyrics show different expressions.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.74,0:26:45.56,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Please give it another listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.64,0:26:49.12,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,There's also an Another Vocal version,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.12,0:26:51.46,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,so please enjoy it in all its forms,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.46,0:26:54.68,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,and play it in the game too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.32,0:26:58.54,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Now, Chouchou-P-san, for this song,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.54,0:27:03.24,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,the Virtual Singer version is sung by Hatsune Miku,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.24,0:27:06.34,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,and it's been a while since we've heard Miku from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.34,0:27:07.78,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,about two years, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.78,0:27:10.60,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,How was it making a song with Miku again after so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.12,0:27:13.93,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Well, it really does feel like the comfort
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.93,0:27:16.48,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,of coming home to your parents' house.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.76,0:27:24.84,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,When I produce songs, I also make guide vocals,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.84,0:27:30.24,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,and sometimes I'd use other software that isn't Vocaloid for those,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.24,0:27:34.12,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,so coming back to Vocaloid, especially Hatsune Miku,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.12,0:27:36.44,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,there's that nostalgic feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.40,0:27:40.16,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Including memories of how things were back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.16,0:27:42.83,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,it's like coming home...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.44,0:27:41.94,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.83,0:27:43.33,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.00,0:27:46.36,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,That part was really great too, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.88,0:27:52.78,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,So you yourself were looking back on the past, in line with the lyrics,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.23,0:27:50.73,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.78,0:27:59.29,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,when you made it. It was released last year, in 2025.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.29,0:27:59.85,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.80,0:28:05.18,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,That's what we've heard so far. We're almost out of time,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.18,0:28:09.56,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,but Suzuki-san, is there anything else you'd like to ask?
Comment: 0,0:28:08.33,0:28:08.83,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.33,0:28:08.83,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.56,0:28:10.24,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Because if we run out of time...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.23,0:28:11.73,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.36,0:28:13.15,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.15,0:28:13.65,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.44,0:28:17.32,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,How are you able to make such warm songs?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.32,0:28:18.08,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.08,0:28:19.76,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Right, not just for Ena,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.76,0:28:21.87,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,but what you value in your style, and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.87,0:28:22.56,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.56,0:28:24.72,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Well, I think it's probably
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.72,0:28:28.63,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,because there was a character like Ena, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.63,0:28:29.24,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.24,0:28:34.20,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,When you make songs on your own without any tie-in,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.20,0:28:38.82,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,or write lyrics, where do you get inspired?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.82,0:28:45.36,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Those gentle, warm words must just be your personality, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.36,0:28:49.44,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know. I'm really grateful you'd say that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.20,0:28:52.80,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,No, really, even the sounds feel so warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.69,0:28:54.19,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,How do...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.76,0:28:59.28,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,How do they come about, how... you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.16,0:29:03.40,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Hmm, I wonder, what, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.52,0:29:09.16,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I can't really put it into words myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.96,0:29:13.30,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,But you usually start from the melody and mood
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.30,0:29:15.48,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,while playing piano or guitar?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.48,0:29:16.11,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.11,0:29:16.65,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.04,0:29:21.64,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,So because your core is warm, the music turns out warm,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.64,0:29:24.32,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,and the lyrics you add at the end do too?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.44,0:29:29.16,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Is there anything we could easily imitate?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.16,0:29:31.08,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Do you have any routines?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.08,0:29:31.84,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Even in daily life.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.72,0:29:37.96,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Not really any routines... Speaking of warm, I had gratin for lunch today.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.96,0:29:41.36,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Oh, gratin! That definitely has warmth to it, real warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.75,0:29:41.25,Chouchou-P - Shifted,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Maybe that's it.
Comment: 0,0:29:41.36,0:29:42.42,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.36,0:29:42.42,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Warm food!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.42,0:29:45.18,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,So, everyone, it's getting chilly,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.18,0:29:48.76,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,so let's eat some warm gratin and warm ourselves up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.20,0:29:53.92,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,That got a little confusing, but we're out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.59,0:29:54.09,Minori Suzuki - Shifted,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Nooo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.92,0:29:56.44,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Chouchou-P-san, a few final words, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.96,0:29:59.86,Chouchou-P,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Honestly, it went by in a flash. I wish I could've talked more,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.86,0:30:02.08,Chouchou-P,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,but it was a really fun time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.08,0:30:03.44,Chouchou-P,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.44,0:30:04.70,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.70,0:30:07.36,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,I'm sure Suzuki-san still wants to talk a bit too...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.36,0:30:10.56,Minori Suzuki,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Seriously, thank you so much for coming, Chouchou-P-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.56,0:30:13.30,Minori Suzuki,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Without you, I wouldn't even be able to be part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.30,0:30:14.28,Minori Suzuki,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.96,0:30:17.36,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Please come back again sometime!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.32,0:30:16.82,Minori Suzuki,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.36,0:30:20.08,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,And with that, our time's flown by.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.08,0:30:21.82,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,There are different versions of the song,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.82,0:30:24.44,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,so please enjoy the Virtual Singer version, the SEKAI version,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.44,0:30:26.84,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,and Ena's Another Vocal version too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.40,0:30:29.40,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Chouchou-P-san, thank you for joining us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.40,0:30:30.32,Chouchou-P,Chouchou-P,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.32,0:30:30.96,Minori Suzuki,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.64,0:30:36.48,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,And thank you to everyone who stayed with us until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.48,0:30:41.12,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Next, starting at 8 PM, we'll bring you the latest ProSeka news.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.12,0:30:42.24,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.84,0:30:43.48,Minori Suzuki,Minori Suzuki,0,0,0,,Thank you!
